[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0118","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0280","title":"Atrium Software Mercur Mail Server SMTP EXPN 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Atrium Software Mercur Mail Server 3.3 的 SMTP 组件在处理 EXPN 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器的 25 端口发送超长 EXPN 命令参数触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，最终可在服务器上以 LocalSystem 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Mercur Mail Server 3.30 及更早版本，攻击无需任何认证，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0280"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Mercur Mail Server 至 3.30 以上版本，或安装厂商发布的安全补丁。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Postfix、Exchange），并在迁移前于防火墙层面限制 SMTP 端口（25/TCP）仅允许可信 IP 访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0413.html","http://www.osvdb.org/6027","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6149","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20647"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0118.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0112","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1442","title":"ISC InterNetNews (INN) innfeed 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ISC InterNetNews (INN) 2.3.0 之前版本中的 innfeed 组件存在命令行缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地 news 组中的攻击者可通过向 innfeed 程序提交超长的 -c 命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取提升的权限。该漏洞影响 ISC INN 2.x 系列版本，攻击前提是攻击者已拥有 news 组本地账户权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1442"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2001-04-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:17.047","remediation":"升级 ISC INN 至 2.3.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 innfeed 的 -c 参数缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，应严格限制 news 组用户的登录权限，移除不必要的组成员，并监控 innfeed 进程的命令行参数长度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0094","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0233","title":"mICQ 0.4.6 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"mICQ 客户端 0.4.6 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的超长 Description 字段消息触发该漏洞，导致目标 mICQ 客户端崩溃（拒绝服务），在特定条件下还可执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有使用 mICQ 0.4.6 及之前版本的用户，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，建议用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0233"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:55.893","remediation":"升级 mICQ 客户端至 0.4.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Description 字段缓冲区溢出问题。Debian 用户可通过 apt-get install micq 更新至安全版本。由于 mICQ 项目已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的 ICQ 兼容客户端（如 Pidgin 或 Adium）以持续获得安全更新。如无法升级，可在防火墙或代理层面过滤 ICQ 协议流量（TCP 端口 5190），限制客户端仅连接可信服务器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0307.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0395.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-012","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-005.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5962","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20569","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0233.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0233","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0233.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0233.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-012.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-5pjr-78vj-8mwr/GHSA-5pjr-78vj-8mwr.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-012.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150700_150800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--385ff1d5-0ff1-4826-bde5-8e2162c3f712.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0094.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0075","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0075.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0197","title":"Icecast 音频流媒体服务器 print_client()格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Icecast 是一款开源的音频流媒体服务器软件，用于在网络上进行音频流的分发和播放。其 print_client 函数存在严重的格式字符串漏洞，该函数在处理客户端请求信息时，未对用户输入数据进行严格过滤，直接将其作为格式化字符串参数传递给格式化输出函数。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造包含特定格式字符（如 %n、%x、%s 等）的恶意请求，利用格式化输出函数的特性读取或篡改进程内存中的数据，最终实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Icecast 1.3.8beta2 及更早所有版本，攻击者仅需能够访问 Icecast 服务端口即可利用，无需任何认证凭证。CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重。建议用户升级到 Icecast 1.3.9 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0197"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:51.830","remediation":"Icecast 1.x 系列已停止维护，不存在针对该漏洞的修补版本。应立即迁移至 Icecast 2.5.0（当前最新稳定版），该版本为完全重写的代码，不受此漏洞影响。下载地址：https://icecast.org/download/。若无法立即迁移，应通过防火墙将 Icecast 服务端口（默认 8000）限制为仅受信 IP 访问，或直接停止 Icecast 1.x 服务。Red Hat 用户可参考安全公告 RHSA-2001-004 获取对应发行版的修复补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0348.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000374","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-004.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2264","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5978","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20582","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0197.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0197","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0197.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0197.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7r5h-rj9j-3ch2/GHSA-7r5h-rj9j-3ch2.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/icecast_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150700_150800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ac5d2918-f1c5-4b6d-abc9-7b18b9ddfb88.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0075.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0072","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0189","title":"LocalWEB2000 HTTP Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"LocalWEB2000 HTTP服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在HTTP GET请求中发送包含\"..\"（点点）序列的特制URL，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于服务器未能正确过滤用户输入中的目录跳转序列，攻击者无需认证即可利用。影响运行LocalWEB2000 1.1版本的Web服务，可能导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0189"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:50.760","remediation":"The user wants me to generate a remediation (修复建议) field for CVE-2001-0189, which is a directory traversal vulnerability in LocalWEB2000 1.1 HTTP server.\n\nThe remediation should be in Chinese, at least 20 characters, specific and actionable - mentioning which version to upgrade to, configuration changes, or mitigation measures.\n\nLocalWEB2000 1.1 is a very old software (vulnerability from 2001). I need to provide practical remediation advice. Since this is an old software that likely no longer receives updates, the advice should focus on upgrading to a newer version if available, or decommissioning/replacing the software.\n\nLet me think about what would be practical:\n1. Upgrade to a patched version (if one exists)\n2. If no patch was ever released, recommend replacing the software\n3. As temporary mitigation, restrict network access\n\nLet me search for more information about this vulnerability first.This is a very old vulnerability from 2001 - LocalWEB2000 1.1 HTTP server directory traversal. The product is likely abandoned/end-of-life. Let me formulate a proper remediation suggestion.\n\nGiven that LocalWEB2000 is a very old and likely discontinued product, the remediation should address:\n1. The product is likely no longer maintained, so upgrading isn't possible\n2. Input validation/filtering as a workaround\n3. Replacing with a modern alternative\n4. Network-level mitigations\n\nLet me write the remediation.<value>立即停止使用 LocalWEB2000 HTTP 服务，该产品已停止维护且无安全补丁。建议迁移至主流 Web 服务器（如 Apache、Nginx、IIS），并在 Web 服务器层面配置 URL 路径规范化规则，拒绝包含 `../` 或 `..\\` 的请求。如无法立即迁移，可部署 WAF 拦截包含目录遍历特征的 GET 请求。\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0346.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2268","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5982","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20585","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6