2001/AVE-2001-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0184","title":"eEye Iris 1.0.1 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"eEye Iris 1.0.1 beta 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向运行该软件的监控系统发送特制的畸形报文或 GET 请求触发此漏洞。当用户在界面中查看该恶意报文时，Iris 程序会崩溃退出，导致网络流量监控功能中断。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，影响 Iris 1.0.1 beta 版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0184"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:50.113","remediation":"升级 eEye Iris 至 1.0.1 以上正式版（避开 beta 版本）。该产品已停止维护（eEye 于 2007 年被 BeyondTrust 收购），建议迁移至 Wireshark 等活跃维护的网络流量分析工具。临时缓解措施：避免在 Iris 中打开或查看来源不可信的畸形报文抓包文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0343.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0352.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2278","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5981","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20589","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0184.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0184","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0184.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0184.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mfp2-hxqg-8hp9/GHSA-mfp2-hxqg-8hp9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2278/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150700_150800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0184.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0070.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0069","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0069.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0183","title":"FreeBSD ipfw/ip6fw 访问限制绕过漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 的 ipfw 和 ip6fw 防火墙组件存在访问控制绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在 TCP 数据包中设置 ECE（Explicit Congestion Notification Echo）标志位，使数据包被误判为已建立连接的一部分，从而绕过防火墙规则实施攻击。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 4.2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。截至目前官方尚未发布完整补丁，建议升级至不受影响版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0183"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:49.973","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 4.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 ipfw/ip6fw 对 TCP ECE 标志的校验逻辑。如无法升级，可在 ipfw 规则中添加 `tcpflags` 匹配规则，拒绝含 ECE 标志的非 SYN 数据包，或使用 pf (Packet Filter) 替代 ipfw 作为防火墙方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-029.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1743","http://www.security-express.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0424.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2293","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5998","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20593","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0183.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0183","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0183.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0183.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-6wc5-6x3h-cm5p/GHSA-6wc5-6x3h-cm5p.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ece_flag.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0d7f96ec-ae19-4776-b6d8-862c237d40a8.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/075941b9745275b361ee02fe877a348f9919b530/2001/CVE-2001-0183.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0068","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0177","title":"WebMaster ConferenceRoom 1.8 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WebMaster ConferenceRoom 1.8.1 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在与 IRC 服务器建立好友关系时克隆服务器连接，导致目标系统资源耗尽而拒绝服务。该漏洞利用方式简单，无需身份认证即可触发，影响 ConferenceRoom 1.8 Developer Edition 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0177"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:49.147","remediation":"升级 ConferenceRoom 至 1.8.2 或更高版本（厂商曾发布补丁修复好友关系验证缺陷）。如产品已停止维护无法升级，建议迁移至 InspIRCd 或 UnrealIRCd 等受支持的现代 IRC 服务器。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上限制 IRC 端口（6660-6669）仅允许可信 IP 通信，并禁用 IRC 服务器克隆（server clone）功能以防止利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/155388","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2178","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5909","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20534","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0177.json","https://github.