_HOST_CONF、HOSTALIASES 和 RES_OPTIONS 等环境变量，导致本地攻击者可通过设置恶意环境变量劫持动态链接库加载路径，从而以提升的权限读取系统上任意文件。该漏洞影响 Linux 系统，攻击者需拥有本地账户权限，利用门槛较低，已有公开利用代码。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0170"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:48.183","remediation":"升级 glibc 至 2.2 或更高版本，该版本在 execve 调用前正确清除了 RESOLV_HOST_CONF、HOSTALIASES 和 RES_OPTIONS 环境变量。对于无法升级的旧系统，可在编译 setuid/setgid 程序时手动调用 unsetenv() 清除上述环境变量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0131.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0186.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-001.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2181","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5907","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/317","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0170.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0170","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0170.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0170.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6558-8g43-2f27/GHSA-6558-8g43-2f27.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150700_150800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7b9715e1-59ea-4f19-99dc-9ad888301019.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0064.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0064.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0063","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0169","title":"GNU glibc LD_PRELOAD 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"glibc 动态链接器在处理 SUID/SGID 程序的 LD_PRELOAD 环境变量时，未验证 /etc/ld.so.cache 中预加载的共享库是否同样具有 SUID/SGID 权限，导致本地低权限用户可通过将恶意共享库放置于 /lib 或 /usr/lib 目录下，利用 LD_PRELOAD 机制使其被 SUID 程序加载，从而以提升后的权限覆盖任意系统文件。该漏洞影响 glibc 2.1.3 及更早版本，攻击者需拥有本地账户且具备对 /lib 或 /usr/lib 目录的写入权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0169"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:48.020","remediation":"升级 glibc 至 2.2.0 或更高版本。Debian 用户应安装 DSA-039 提供的更新包；Red Hat 用户应用对应安全 errata。如无法立即升级，可移除 SUID/SGID 二进制文件的 LD_PRELOAD 环境变量支持作为临时缓解，但建议优先完成 glibc 版本升级以彻底修复此漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/turbolinux/2001-q1/0004.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-007.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-039","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-012.php3?dis=7.2","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_001_glibc_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-002.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/157650","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2223","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5971","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/290","ht