2001-03-13T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:51.393","remediation":"立即升级到 Icecast 2.x 或更高版本（当前支持的安全分支）。如果无法立即升级，可在防火墙上限制对 Icecast 端口的访问，并禁用匿名或未认证的流发布功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98455723123298&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-089","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-063.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1230.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1230","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1230.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1230.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/icecast_rbof.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fchq-jwhc-r9q2/GHSA-fchq-jwhc-r9q2.json","https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-ports/blob/58376fbc0dd642d78dda39e7bbfa81a124730b7d/security/vuxml/vuln/2004.xml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1230.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-089.nasl","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2004/FreeBSD-2004-0016.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0379.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0050","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0122","title":"IBM HTTP Server 1.3.x AfpaCache 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IBM HTTP Server 1.3.x 及 WebSphere 3.52 的 Fast Response Cache Accelerator (FRCA) 组件中的 AfpaCache 模块存在内核泄漏漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送一系列特制的畸形 HTTP 请求，触发 \"bad request\" 错误，导致目标系统的内核资源持续泄漏，最终造成拒绝服务。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，影响范围包括多个版本的 IBM HTTP Server 和 WebSphere 应用服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0122"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-13T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:41.827","remediation":"升级 IBM HTTP Server 至 1.3.19.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 FRCA 模块中 AfpaCache 的内存泄漏缺陷。若暂时无法升级，可在配置文件中禁用 FRCA（Fast Response Cache Accelerator）模块以消除攻击面，具体操作为在 httpd.conf 中注释或移除与 FRCA/AfpaCache 相关的 LoadModule 和 CacheInit 指令。对于仍运行 Websphere 3.52 的环境，建议同步升级 Websphere Application Server 至受支持的版本（如 5.x 或更高），因为该版本同样受此漏洞影响。此外，可在前置防火墙层面过滤异常畸形 HTTP 请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0079.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0061.html","http://www-4.ibm.com/software/webservers/security.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2175","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5900","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20531","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-0122.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0122.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0122","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0122.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0122.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r52p-5vj2-qhxc/GHSA-r52p-5vj2-qhxc.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0122.yaml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0122.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0421","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0421.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0925","title":"Apache HTTP Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Apache 1.3.19 之前版本的默认安装中存在路径遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含大量连续斜杠（/）字符的特制 HTTP 请求，导致服务器在处理请求路径时错误地绕过 multiview 机制，直接列出目录文件列表而非返回 index.html 索引页面。该漏洞影响 mod_negotiation、mod_dir 和 mod_autoindex 三个模块，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，导致敏感目录结构及文件信息泄露。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0925"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:14.357","remediation":"升级 Apache 至 1.3.19 或更高版本。Debian 用户可参考 DSA-067 安全公告安装更新，Mandrake 用户可参考 MDKSA-2001-077 获取补丁。如无法立即升级，在 httpd.conf 中移除 Options 指令中的 Indexes 参数，并确保 DirectoryIndex index.html 配置正确，同时禁用 mod_autoindex 模块以缓解目录列表泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.apacheweek.com/features/security-13","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-067","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-077.php3","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1452.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/168497","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/178066","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/193081","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2503","http://www.securityfocus.com/cgi-bin/archive.pl?id=1&start=2002